  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Clingendael Training South West Region. This concerns a training for the Regional President and 9 of his cabinet members.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CdP visited the regional president in August 2022 to discuss business opportunities and development cooperation. Dr Negash Wagesho, the former state minister of water supply was appointed President of the newly established South West Region. This visit was the first time an ambassador ever came by. 
During this visit, the president raised the possibility of training members of his newly formed cabinet in order to enhance their capacity to lead and manage the SWR effectively. 
A training program for the president and his cabinet members will be organised at the Clingendael Institute in The Hague, from February 19th to March 1st, 2024.</narrative>
  </description>
